{
  "id": "boss_gulgarra",
  "name": "Gulgarra of the Drowned Vent",
  "tier": "boss",
  "body": "vent_wisp",
  "place": "dungeon drowned_vent (The Drowned Vent, Fumarole Fen, level 14-16): the end boss at the vent mouth",
  "_doc": "The vent itself, risen as a spirit of hot gas and black water. P1 \"Breathing\": a hot breath cone, scald spouts under random players, and the vent mouth breathing out rings of steam. Two sluice wheels (levers, repeatable) drain the scalding water it spills (pools) out of the chamber. P2 at 60% \"Low Water\": three mud mounds stand in the room; it draws all the gas in and lets it out as a blast you hide from behind the mounds (each blast cracks the mound that saved you). P3 new bar \"The Vent Opens\": a ring you must be in close or far for, gas on each player that spreads, and a stack. OWNER #51 (2026-10-15): the phase that refilled the health bar is removed; the health bar is the whole fight.",
  "party": "Solo: drain the water, use the mounds wisely (they break). 2-3: share the mounds. 5: as designed.",
  "hpMult": 3.8,
